{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Dead Doves</strong> is a short, singleplayer, fixed-perspective horror story set in the heart of the Appalachian wilderness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564540/extras/f54180785e4e498f352442021dc4955c.poster.avif?t=1760029972\" width=600 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564540/extras/f54180785e4e498f352442021dc4955c.webm?t=1760029972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564540/extras/f54180785e4e498f352442021dc4955c.mp4?t=1760029972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > It's 2004. The mountains are much older.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Marcus Stetson</strong> -- the Most Pathetic Man on Earth -- a seasoned backpacker on the Appalachian Trail who decides to pool his resources to team up one last time with his human firecracker of a trail buddy, <strong>Sean</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564540/extras/3d0c6b9cde0dd39e74db258d51e5ebdc.poster.avif?t=1760029972\" width=600 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564540/extras/3d0c6b9cde0dd39e74db258d51e5ebdc.webm?t=1760029972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564540/extras/3d0c6b9cde0dd39e74db258d51e5ebdc.mp4?t=1760029972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their mission is to relive the glory days and embark on one final outing: To pinpoint and find the truth behind the holy grail of urban legends: a mysterious, mythical place known in whispers as the <strong>Ant Farm</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564540/extras/698a2f1633cfb9027c980722304b4b4c.poster.avif?t=1760029972\" width=600 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564540/extras/698a2f1633cfb9027c980722304b4b4c.webm?t=1760029972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564540/extras/698a2f1633cfb9027c980722304b4b4c.mp4?t=1760029972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During their journey, their bond, will, and wits are put to the test when Mark receives a series of cryptic messages in his dreams from a <strong>haunting, bird-like figure</strong>\u00a0named <strong>The Wren</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564540/extras/e4c34431581508666e62e596c2985fd5.poster.avif?t=1760029972\" width=600 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564540/extras/e4c34431581508666e62e596c2985fd5.webm?t=1760029972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564540/extras/e4c34431581508666e62e596c2985fd5.mp4?t=1760029972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you discover why the<strong> birds are dropping dead</strong> -- or will you leave behind <i><strong>nothing but footprints</strong></i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564540/extras/774ab338d60f115f90e4e35b0e7ef5d4.poster.avif?t=1760029972\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564540/extras/774ab338d60f115f90e4e35b0e7ef5d4.webm?t=1760029972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564540/extras/774ab338d60f115f90e4e35b0e7ef5d4.mp4?t=1760029972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564540/extras/c7b42a0e43fa3935cf019b5b30b1bb27.avif?t=1760029972\" width=604 height=184 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a fully realized narrative</strong> full of\u00a0mystery, heart,\u00a0and\u00a0mortal terror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate The Wren's peculiar\u00a0Dove Dreams</strong>, and uncover\u00a0multiple endings\u00a0that will affect both your\u00a0past and future.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy a cinematic Dovecraftian adventure</strong> -- complete with\u00a0fully-voiced animated cutscenes\u00a0&amp; and a\u00a0rich original score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience a thrilling\u00a0psychological horror campaign</strong>\u00a0with\u00a0secrets\u00a0tucked into every corner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve puzzles, crack open mysteries</strong>, and uncover the\u00a0secrets\u00a0deep Appalachia holds\u2026</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover\u00a0beautiful environments, strange locations,\u00a0and\u00a0stranger locales</strong>\u00a0with\u00a0charmingly disturbing '00s-inspired visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Follow the quest of the hiking duo, Mark and Sean</strong>, on their quest to find the mythical\u00a0Ant Farm.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564540/extras/aab5c921450a657fe24258a2e55cbc75.poster.avif?t=1760029972\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564540/extras/aab5c921450a657fe24258a2e55cbc75.webm?t=1760029972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564540/extras/aab5c921450a657fe24258a2e55cbc75.mp4?t=1760029972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Early Bird","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1564540/f337533ce386b8027c002d45be40d5bd3df0dacf.jpg"},{"name":"After Dark","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1564540/856e49bc973b831c24a6e2c1ef45442bb59d6d3b.jpg"},{"name":"Poking, Prodding","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1564540/acd45292f0b965e412a325da6d119d3ce0c6e4ae.jpg"},{"name":"Internal Processor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1564540/e405e9ad02e1ec9eeee5ded12c24ca7fa426be18.jpg"},{"name":"Cytokine Storm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1564540/5c924ced64e97066898fb1e501aa776d31259c92.jpg"},{"name":"Exit Strategy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1564540/2ffca6a19c94175cbb9d5d39e4346a81ae77ddff.jpg"},{"name":"The Maestro","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1564540/2ae0b00591f76ed6198bf2eae3223df28e99d96f.jpg"},{"name":"The Dreamer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1564540/126fe44ba1f3dff9caf4d8884822357e65acdf5f.jpg"},{"name":"Campfire Story","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1564540/4f394b7073be9a22b3d2320219b9fb98bd25868d.jpg"},{"name":"Ten Pages","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1564540/e3e1fc8fa09340b469e83391b575d42be4d64e48.jpg"}],"total":24},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1564540?t=1760029972","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564540/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760029972","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564540/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760029972","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564540/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760029972","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"10 Dead Doves contains: General Mature Content -- moderate crude language; occasional swearing, use of alcohol or tobacco, insinuated depiction(s) of suicide, and strong psychological horror elements."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Dead Doves</strong> is a short, singleplayer, fixed-perspective horror story set in the heart of the Appalachian wilderness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564540/extras/f54180785e4e498f352442021dc4